<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q2 net loss $4 mln.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Smurfit Corp Q2 net loss $4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			     (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Earnings per shr ($)   0.04 loss	    vs 0.24 profit</p>
<p> Net income		 4 loss		 vs 27 profit</p>
<p> Net sales		  785		    vs 844</p>
<p> Income from operations 44		     vs 92</p>
<p> Net interest expense   47		     vs 48</p>
<p> Provision for tax	1			vs 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Jefferson Smurfit Corporation is a 46.5 percent owned associate of Irish-based paper and packaging manufacturer Jefferson Smurfit Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
